.SS "void on_window_destroy (GtkWidget * widget, gpointer data)"

.PP
Callback to the signal of window destroy\&. Properly disposes of elements in memory\&. Destroys the planet and the \fBGameUI\fP by freeing the memory, then calls gtk_main_quit() to exit the program\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIwidget\fP a GtkWidget (probably the main window) 
.br
\fIdata\fP the data provided by the callback, it should be of type \fBGameUI\fP * 
.RE
.PP

.SS "void runGUIGame (int argc, char * argv[])"

.PP
Runs the full game, turn by turn, until win condition or game over is reached\&. This function will initialize everything to a playable state, before launching the game loop, once the loop stops it will handle memory deallocation as well\&.

